{
  "id": null,
  "uid": "cert-manager",
  "title": "cert-manager",
  "description": "Certificate expiry, readiness and renewal, ACME request health and controller errors for cert-manager.",
  "tags": [
    "cert-manager",
    "certificates",
    "platform",
    "homelab"
  ],
  "schemaVersion": 39,
  "version": 1,
  "refresh": "1m",
  "time": {
    "from": "now-6h",
    "to": "now"
  },
  "links": [
    {
      "title": "Dashboards",
      "type": "dashboards",
      "tags": [
        "homelab"
      ],
      "asDropdown": true,
      "includeVars": false,
      "keepTime": true,
      "icon": "dashboard"
    }
  ],
  "templating": {
    "list": [
      {
        "name": "datasource",
        "type": "datasource",
        "query": "prometheus",
        "refresh": 1,
        "current": {
          "text": "VictoriaMetrics",
          "value": "VictoriaMetrics"
        },
        "regex": "",
        "hide": 2,
        "options": []
      }
    ]
  },
  "panels": [
    {
      "id": 1,
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "Controller scrape",
      "description": "1 while vmagent scrapes the cert-manager controller. DOWN or No data means every other tile is stale.",
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 5,
        "w": 4,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 0
      },
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "${datasource}"
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "min(up{job=\"cert-manager\"})",
          "instant": true
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "short",
          "noValue": "No data",
          "mappings": [
            {
              "type": "value",
              "options": {
                "0": {
                  "text": "DOWN",
                  "color": "red",
                  "index": 0
                },
                "1": {
                  "text": "UP",
                  "color": "green",
                  "index": 1
                }
              }
            }
          ],
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "red"
              },
              {
                "color": "green",
                "value": 1
              }
            ]
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "colorMode": "background",
        "graphMode": "none",
        "justifyMode": "center",
        "reduceOptions": {
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull"
          ],
          "fields": "",
          "values": false
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "Certificates",
      "description": "Certificates cert-manager reports on.",
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 5,
        "w": 4,
        "x": 4,
        "y": 0
      },
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "${datasource}"
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "count(certmanager_certificate_ready_status{condition=\"True\"})",
          "instant": true
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "short",
          "noValue": "No data",
          "color": {
            "mode": "fixed",
            "fixedColor": "blue"
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "colorMode": "value",
        "graphMode": "none",
        "justifyMode": "center",
        "reduceOptions": {
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull"
          ],
          "fields": "",
          "values": false
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "Not ready",
      "description": "Certificates whose Ready condition is not True. No data means no certificate metrics at all.",
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 5,
        "w": 4,
        "x": 8,
        "y": 0
      },
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "${datasource}"
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "count(certmanager_certificate_ready_status{condition=\"True\"} == 0) or (0 * count(certmanager_certificate_ready_status{condition=\"True\"}))",
          "instant": true
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "short",
          "noValue": "No data",
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "gray"
              },
              {
                "color": "green",
                "value": 0
              },
              {
                "color": "red",
                "value": 1
              }
            ]
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "colorMode": "background",
        "graphMode": "none",
        "justifyMode": "center",
        "reduceOptions": {
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull"
          ],
          "fields": "",
          "values": false
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "Soonest expiry",
      "description": "Days until the earliest certificate expires. Let's Encrypt certificates are renewed about 30 days before expiry, so this should stay above 21. Red below 7 days. Certificates that were never issued (no expiry yet) are left out; the Not ready panels show them.",
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 5,
        "w": 4,
        "x": 12,
        "y": 0
      },
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "${datasource}"
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "min(((certmanager_certificate_expiration_timestamp_seconds > 0) - time()) / 86400)",
          "instant": true
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "suffix: d",
          "decimals": 1,
          "noValue": "No data",
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "red"
              },
              {
                "color": "orange",
                "value": 7
              },
              {
                "color": "green",
                "value": 21
              }
            ]
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "colorMode": "background",
        "graphMode": "none",
        "justifyMode": "center",
        "reduceOptions": {
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull"
          ],
          "fields": "",
          "values": false
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "Renewal overdue",
      "description": "Certificates more than an hour past their renewal time and not yet renewed: renewal is failing or stuck.",
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 5,
        "w": 4,
        "x": 16,
        "y": 0
      },
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "${datasource}"
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "count((certmanager_certificate_renewal_timestamp_seconds > 0) and ((time() - certmanager_certificate_renewal_timestamp_seconds) > 3600)) or (0 * count(certmanager_certificate_renewal_timestamp_seconds))",
          "instant": true
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "short",
          "noValue": "No data",
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "gray"
              },
              {
                "color": "green",
                "value": 0
              },
              {
                "color": "red",
                "value": 1
              }
            ]
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "colorMode": "background",
        "graphMode": "none",
        "justifyMode": "center",
        "reduceOptions": {
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull"
          ],
          "fields": "",
          "values": false
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 6,
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "Non-2xx ACME responses",
      "description": "Outbound ACME responses that were not 2xx in the selected range; transport errors count as status 999. The ACME client retries a stale nonce (400 badNonce) by itself, so an isolated 400 is usually harmless; repeated ones together with Not ready or Renewal overdue mean issuance is failing. The counter only exists after the first request, so none shows 0.",
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 5,
        "w": 4,
        "x": 20,
        "y": 0
      },
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "${datasource}"
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "sum(increase(certmanager_http_acme_client_request_count{status!~\"2..\"}[$__range])) or vector(0)",
          "instant": true
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "short",
          "decimals": 0,
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "green"
              },
              {
                "color": "orange",
                "value": 1
              }
            ]
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "colorMode": "background",
        "graphMode": "none",
        "justifyMode": "center",
        "reduceOptions": {
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull"
          ],
          "fields": "",
          "values": false
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 7,
      "type": "table",
      "title": "Certificates by expiry",
      "description": "Every certificate with the days left until it expires, soonest first. Colour: red below 7 days, orange below 21. Certificates that were never issued (no expiry yet) are left out; the Not ready panels show them.",
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 9,
        "w": 14,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 5
      },
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "${datasource}"
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "sort(sum by (namespace, name, issuer_name) ((certmanager_certificate_expiration_timestamp_seconds > 0) - time()) / 86400)",
          "instant": true,
          "format": "table"
        }
      ],
      "transformations": [
        {
          "id": "organize",
          "options": {
            "excludeByName": {
              "Time": true,
              "__name__": true,
              "issuer_kind": true,
              "issuer_group": true
            },
            "indexByName": {
              "namespace": 0,
              "name": 1,
              "issuer_name": 2,
              "Value": 3
            },
            "renameByName": {
              "namespace": "Namespace",
              "name": "Certificate",
              "issuer_name": "Issuer",
              "Value": "Days left"
            }
          }
        }
      ],
      "options": {
        "showHeader": true,
        "cellHeight": "sm",
        "sortBy": [
          {
            "displayName": "Days left",
            "desc": false
          }
        ]
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "suffix: d",
          "decimals": 1,
          "noValue": "—"
        },
        "overrides": [
          {
            "matcher": {
              "id": "byName",
              "options": "Days left"
            },
            "properties": [
              {
                "id": "custom.width",
                "value": 120
              },
              {
                "id": "custom.cellOptions",
                "value": {
                  "type": "color-background"
                }
              },
              {
                "id": "thresholds",
                "value": {
                  "mode": "absolute",
                  "steps": [
                    {
                      "color": "red"
                    },
                    {
                      "color": "orange",
                      "value": 7
                    },
                    {
                      "color": "green",
                      "value": 21
                    }
                  ]
                }
              },
              {
                "id": "color",
                "value": {
                  "mode": "thresholds"
                }
              }
            ]
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 8,
      "type": "table",
      "title": "Certificates not ready",
      "description": "Certificates whose current condition is False or Unknown.",
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 9,
        "w": 10,
        "x": 14,
        "y": 5
      },
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "${datasource}"
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "sum by (namespace, name, condition, issuer_name) (certmanager_certificate_ready_status{condition!=\"True\"} == 1)",
          "instant": true,
          "format": "table"
        }
      ],
      "transformations": [
        {
          "id": "organize",
          "options": {
            "excludeByName": {
              "Time": true,
              "__name__": true,
              "issuer_kind": true,
              "issuer_group": true,
              "Value": true
            },
            "indexByName": {
              "namespace": 0,
              "name": 1,
              "condition": 2,
              "issuer_name": 3,
              "Value": 4
            },
            "renameByName": {
              "namespace": "Namespace",
              "name": "Certificate",
              "condition": "Condition",
              "issuer_name": "Issuer",
              "Value": "State"
            }
          }
        }
      ],
      "options": {
        "showHeader": true,
        "cellHeight": "sm"
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "short",
          "decimals": 0,
          "noValue": "All certificates ready"
        },
        "overrides": []
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 9,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Days until expiry",
      "description": "Days left per certificate. The lines mark 7 and 21 days. Certificates that were never issued (no expiry yet) are left out; the Not ready panels show them.",
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 8,
        "w": 12,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 14
      },
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "${datasource}"
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "((certmanager_certificate_expiration_timestamp_seconds > 0) - time()) / 86400",
          "legendFormat": "{{namespace}}/{{name}}"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "suffix: d",
          "color": {
            "mode": "palette-classic"
          },
          "custom": {
            "thresholdsStyle": {
              "mode": "line"
            }
          },
          "decimals": 1,
          "min": 0,
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "red"
              },
              {
                "color": "orange",
                "value": 7
              },
              {
                "color": "green",
                "value": 21
              }
            ]
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "list",
          "placement": "bottom",
          "showLegend": true
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "multi",
          "sort": "desc"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 10,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "ACME requests by status",
      "description": "Outbound ACME requests per displayed interval (minimum 5 minutes), by HTTP status.",
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 8,
        "w": 12,
        "x": 12,
        "y": 14
      },
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "${datasource}"
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "sum by (status) (increase(certmanager_http_acme_client_request_count[$__interval]))",
          "legendFormat": "{{status}}"
        }
      ],
      "interval": "5m",
      "maxDataPoints": 300,
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "short",
          "color": {
            "mode": "palette-classic"
          },
          "custom": {
            "drawStyle": "bars",
            "fillOpacity": 65,
            "spanNulls": false,
            "stacking": {
              "group": "A",
              "mode": "normal"
            }
          },
          "decimals": 0
        },
        "overrides": [
          {
            "matcher": {
              "id": "byName",
              "options": "200"
            },
            "properties": [
              {
                "id": "color",
                "value": {
                  "mode": "fixed",
                  "fixedColor": "green"
                }
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "matcher": {
              "id": "byName",
              "options": "201"
            },
            "properties": [
              {
                "id": "color",
                "value": {
                  "mode": "fixed",
                  "fixedColor": "green"
                }
              }
            ]
          }
        ]
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "list",
          "placement": "bottom",
          "showLegend": true
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "multi",
          "sort": "desc"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 11,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "ACME request latency (mean)",
      "description": "Mean outbound ACME request latency, by ACME action. cert-manager exports this latency as a summary (per-series 0.5/0.9/0.99 quantiles, no histogram buckets), and summary quantiles cannot be aggregated across series, so the panel shows the mean. Gaps are normal: ACME requests only happen around issuance and renewal.",
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 8,
        "w": 8,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 22
      },
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "${datasource}"
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "sum by (action) (rate(certmanager_http_acme_client_request_duration_seconds_sum[$__rate_interval])) / sum by (action) (rate(certmanager_http_acme_client_request_duration_seconds_count[$__rate_interval]))",
          "legendFormat": "{{action}}"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "s",
          "color": {
            "mode": "palette-classic"
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "list",
          "placement": "bottom",
          "showLegend": true
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "multi",
          "sort": "desc"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 12,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Controller syncs per second",
      "description": "sync() calls per cert-manager controller.",
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 8,
        "w": 8,
        "x": 8,
        "y": 22
      },
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "${datasource}"
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "sum by (controller) (rate(certmanager_controller_sync_call_count[$__rate_interval]))",
          "legendFormat": "{{controller}}"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "ops",
          "color": {
            "mode": "palette-classic"
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "list",
          "placement": "bottom",
          "showLegend": true
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "multi",
          "sort": "desc"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 13,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Controller sync errors",
      "description": "Errors during controller sync() per displayed interval (minimum 5 minutes). The counter only exists after the first error.",
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 8,
        "w": 8,
        "x": 16,
        "y": 22
      },
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "${datasource}"
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "sum by (controller) (increase(certmanager_controller_sync_error_count[$__interval]))",
          "legendFormat": "{{controller}}"
        }
      ],
      "interval": "5m",
      "maxDataPoints": 300,
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "short",
          "color": {
            "mode": "palette-classic"
          },
          "custom": {
            "drawStyle": "bars",
            "fillOpacity": 65,
            "spanNulls": false,
            "stacking": {
              "group": "A",
              "mode": "normal"
            }
          },
          "decimals": 0
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "list",
          "placement": "bottom",
          "showLegend": true
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "multi",
          "sort": "desc"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 14,
      "type": "text",
      "title": "Reading this dashboard",
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 5,
        "w": 24,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 30
      },
      "options": {
        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": "**Source.** Metrics from the cert-manager controller (`certmanager_*`), scraped by the `cert-manager` VMServiceScrape. Names and labels checked against cert-manager v1.21.2.\n\n- A certificate has one `certmanager_certificate_ready_status` series per condition (True, False, Unknown); the current one is 1.\n- Renewal is expected about 30 days before expiry, so a healthy 90-day certificate sits between 30 and 90 days left.\n- \"Renewal overdue\" counts certificates an hour past their renewal time: cert-manager normally renews within minutes.\n- A certificate that was never issued reports expiry 0; the expiry panels leave it out and the Not ready panels show it.\n- ACME latency is a summary metric, so the dashboard shows the mean per action, not a percentile.\n- ACME and sync-error counters only exist after their first event, so empty panels there are normal."
      }
    }
  ],
  "graphTooltip": 1
}
